data: {"answer": "這裡是宴會廳電視近看區域，螢幕上顯示的是活動的 CRM 儀表板。公共區域的螢幕不能顯示客人個資，需注意資料遮蔽、桌面淨空與螢幕淨空等防護措施。此處系統包含 CRM 與會員系統，潛在威脅為資料寄錯人、偷窺與螢幕外露。", "go": [], "followups": [{"text": "CRM 與會員系統是做什麼的？", "en": "What does the CRM & Loyalty do?", "zh": "CRM 與會員系統是做什麼的？"}, {"text": "資料寄錯人要怎麼防？", "en": "How do we prevent data sent to the wrong person?", "zh": "資料寄錯人要怎麼防？"}, {"text": "接下來要去哪？", "en": "What should I do next?", "zh": "接下來要去哪？"}], "trace": {"session": "offline", "lang": "zh", "model": "qwen3.5:9b", "timings": {"route_s": 0.0, "tool_s": 0.01, "answer_s": 8.18, "total_s": 8.2}, "route": {"tool": "room_overview", "target": "", "how": "button"}, "link": {"query": "(current room)", "chosen": "banquet_tv", "how": "current room"}, "redirect": "", "queries": [{"purpose": "everything placed in this room", "cypher": "MATCH (r:Room {key:$k}) RETURN r {.key, .name_en, .name_zh, .it_en, .it_zh, .tour, .url, .url_index, .area, .kind, .story, .theme_en, .theme_zh, .lesson_en, .lesson_zh} AS r, [(r)-[:IN_AREA]->(a) | a {.key, .name_en, .name_zh}][0] AS area, [(r)-[:CLOSEUP_OF]->(p) | p {.key, .name_en, .name_zh, .it_en, .it_zh, .tour, .url, .url_index, .area, .kind, .story, .theme_en, .theme_zh, .lesson_en, .lesson_zh}][0] AS parent, [(s:System)-[:LOCATED_IN]->(r) | s {.key, .name_en, .name_zh, .desc_en, .desc_zh}] AS systems, [(t:Threat)-[:SHOWN_IN]->(r) | t {.key, .name_en, .name_zh, .desc_en, .desc_zh}] AS threats, [(c:Control)-[:SEEN_IN]->(r) | c {.key, .name_en, .name_zh, .desc_en, .desc_zh, .type}] AS controls, [(c:Concept)-[:TAUGHT_IN]->(r) | c {.key, .name_en, .name_zh, .desc_en, .desc_zh}] AS concepts, [(p:Procedure)-[:PRACTISED_IN]->(r) | p {.key, .name_en, .name_zh, .kind}] AS procedures, [(d:Department)-[:BASED_IN]->(r) | d {.key, .name_en, .name_zh, .desc_en, .desc_zh, .ext}] AS departments, [(cs:CaseStudy)-[:SHOWN_IN]->(r) | cs {.key, .name_en, .name_zh, .year}] AS cases, [(r)-[l:LINKS_TO]->(x) | x {.key, .name_en, .name_zh, .it_en, .it_zh, .tour, .url, .url_index, .area, .kind, .story, .theme_en, .theme_zh, .lesson_en, .lesson_zh, teleport: l.teleport}] AS exits, size([(f:Finding)-[:IN_ROOM]->(r) | f]) AS findings_here", "params": {"k": "banquet_tv"}, "rows": 1, "ms": 5.8}], "graph": {"nodes": [{"key": "banquet_tv", "label": "Room", "en": "Banquet TV · Up Close", "zh": "宴會廳電視近看"}, {"key": "crm", "label": "System", "en": "CRM & Loyalty", "zh": "CRM 與會員系統"}, {"key": "misdelivery", "label": "Threat", "en": "Data Sent to the Wrong Person", "zh": "資料寄錯人"}, {"key": "shoulder_surfing", "label": "Threat", "en": "Shoulder Surfing & Screen Exposure", "zh": "偷窺與螢幕外露"}, {"key": "data_masking", "label": "Control", "en": "Data Masking", "zh": "資料遮蔽"}, {"key": "clear_desk", "label": "Control", "en": "Clear Desk & Clear Screen", "zh": "桌面淨空與螢幕淨空"}, {"key": "c_crm", "label": "Concept", "en": "Customer Relationship Management (CRM)", "zh": "顧客關係管理（CRM）"}], "edges": [{"a": "crm", "t": "LOCATED_IN", "b": "banquet_tv"}, {"a": "misdelivery", "t": "SHOWN_IN", "b": "banquet_tv"}, {"a": "shoulder_surfing", "t": "TARGETS", "b": "crm"}, {"a": "shoulder_surfing", "t": "SHOWN_IN", "b": "banquet_tv"}, {"a": "c_crm", "t": "TAUGHT_IN", "b": "banquet_tv"}, {"a": "c_crm", "t": "RELATED_TO", "b": "crm"}, {"a": "clear_desk", "t": "SEEN_IN", "b": "banquet_tv"}, {"a": "clear_desk", "t": "MITIGATES", "b": "shoulder_surfing"}, {"a": "clear_desk", "t": "MITIGATES", "b": "misdelivery"}, {"a": "data_masking", "t": "SEEN_IN", "b": "banquet_tv"}, {"a": "data_masking", "t": "MITIGATES", "b": "shoulder_surfing"}, {"a": "data_masking", "t": "MITIGATES", "b": "misdelivery"}]}, "tool_used": "room_overview", "facts": "房間：宴會廳電視近看・CRM 畫面\n代表的資訊主題：大螢幕上顯示活動的 CRM 儀表板。\n重點：公共區域的螢幕不能顯示客人的個資。\n這裡的系統：CRM 與會員系統\n這裡要注意的威脅：資料寄錯人、偷窺與螢幕外露\n看得到的防護措施：資料遮蔽、桌面淨空與螢幕淨空\n課程概念：顧客關係管理（CRM）\n相關的處理流程：個資寄錯人\n這個房間藏著 1 個資安漏洞（要玩家自己找，不要說出來）\n可以走到：宴會廳・活動與 CRM", "answer_stats": {"model": "qwen3.5:9b", "wall_s": 8.18, "load_s": 0.0, "prompt_tokens": 590, "prompt_s": 2.22, "gen_tokens": 73, "gen_s": 5.93, "tok_per_s": 12.3, "first_token_s": 2.25}}, "state": {}}

